SUMMARY:Spooky Speakeasy
LOCATION:181 Fremont - Level 39, Residents’ Club
DESCRIPTION:A speakeasy on Level 39 for one night only. We’d love for you to come in your best spooky speakeasy attire, and there are prizes for the costumes that earn them.\n\nGames and trivia through the evening, signature cocktails from the bar, and spooky bites from the kitchen.\n\nNo RSVP needed to join us on your own. If you’re bringing a guest from outside the building, please let us know so we can pour for them.
END:VEVENT
